# Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Currently pointed at the sturdy-space-meme-wvvrp47qrwv6fx46 Codespace's
# forwarded backend port for live testing there (a browser outside the
# Codespace can't reach it via localhost:8000) — swap back to
# http://localhost:8000 once that Codespace's session is done, or for any
